{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 05 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">自监督学习：对比、聚类、自蒸馏与遮挡重建</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Self-Supervised Learning</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_026_mae-title\">MAE</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">高比例随机遮蔽后仅编码可见 patch，再用轻量 decoder 重建 mask patch 的非对称自编码器。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Asymmetric autoencoder that masks 75% of image patches, encodes only the 25% visible tokens with a heavy ViT, and reconstructs pixels via a lightweight decoder.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">随机遮蔽大比例 patch 的图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Image with a high proportion (e.g., 75%) of randomly masked patches</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">重建的被遮蔽 patch 与预训练视觉 encoder</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Reconstructed masked patches during pretraining; high-capacity ViT encoder for downstream fine-tuning</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.1</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2022/html/He_Masked_Autoencoders_Are_Scalable_Vision_Learners_CVPR_2022_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_026_mae')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_026_mae')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"MAE original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/0bbd46531fb956c95cf0.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.1</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_026_mae', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_026_mae\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_026_mae')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_026_mae', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_026_mae\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">图像切成固定大小的非重叠 patch。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests image with a high proportion (e.g., 75%) of randomly masked patches and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"图像切成固定大小的非重叠 patch。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests image with a high proportion (e.g., 75%) of randomly masked patches and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_026_mae', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图像切成固定大小的非重叠 patch。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests image with a high proportion (e.g., 75%) of randomly masked patches and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每幅图随机打乱 patch，仅保留少量可见 token。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes masked 75% to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"随机遮蔽 75%\" data-node-name-en=\"masked 75%\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_026_mae', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">随机遮蔽 75%</span><span class=\"lang-en\">masked 75%</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每幅图随机打乱 patch，仅保留少量可见 token。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes masked 75% to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"只有未遮蔽 patch 被线性嵌入并送入 encoder。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Tokens within the core asymmetric masked autoencoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"可见 Tokens\" data-node-name-en=\"Tokens\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_026_mae', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">可见 Tokens</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Tokens</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">只有未遮蔽 patch 被线性嵌入并送入 encoder。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Tokens within the core asymmetric masked autoencoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"高容量 encoder 仅处理约 25% token，显著降低预训练计算。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs ViT Encoder within the core asymmetric masked autoencoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"重型 ViT Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"ViT Encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_026_mae', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">重型 ViT Encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">ViT Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">高容量 encoder 仅处理约 25% token，显著降低预训练计算。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs ViT Encoder within the core asymmetric masked autoencoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把可见编码投影到 decoder 维度，插入共享 mask token 并按原位置复原序列。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Mask Token within the core asymmetric masked autoencoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"补 Mask Token\" data-node-name-en=\"Mask Token\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_026_mae', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">补 Mask Token</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Mask Token</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把可见编码投影到 decoder 维度，插入共享 mask token 并按原位置复原序列。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Mask Token within the core asymmetric masked autoencoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"较浅、较窄的 Transformer 同时处理可见与 mask token。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Decoder within the core asymmetric masked autoencoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"轻量 Decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Decoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_026_mae', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">轻量 Decoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">较浅、较窄的 Transformer 同时处理可见与 mask token。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Decoder within the core asymmetric masked autoencoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个 token 预测对应 patch 的归一化像素值。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs pixel prediction within the core asymmetric masked autoencoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"像素预测头\" data-node-name-en=\"pixel prediction\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_026_mae', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">像素预测头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">pixel prediction</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个 token 预测对应 patch 的归一化像素值。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs pixel prediction within the core asymmetric masked autoencoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"均方误差只在被遮蔽 patch 上计算。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Masked MSE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Masked MSE\" data-node-name-en=\"Masked MSE\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_026_mae', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Masked MSE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">均方误差只在被遮蔽 patch 上计算。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Masked MSE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预训练结束后丢弃 decoder，仅迁移 encoder。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces reconstructed masked patches during pretraining; high-capacity vit encoder for downstream fine-tuning via Encoder.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"下游 Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_026_mae', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">下游 Encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预训练结束后丢弃 decoder，仅迁移 encoder。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces reconstructed masked patches during pretraining; high-capacity vit encoder for downstream fine-tuning via Encoder.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"MAE Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 只在被遮 patch 上计算像素重建误差</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Masked Patch Pixel Mean-Squared Error Computed Strictly on Masked Tokens</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"MAE：核心公式 · 只在被遮 patch 上计算像素重建误差\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"26\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"25.655756pt\" preserveaspectratio