4189L1.151349-.942915C.942915-.645152 .754332-.466495 .645152-.466495C.5856-.466495 .486346-.496271 .387091-.555824C.258061-.625301 .158807-.655078 .069478-.655078C-.12903-.655078-.267986-.506196-.267986-.307688C-.267986-.049627-.079403 .10918 .228285 .10918S.655078 .019851 1.151349-.575674L2.044636-1.746874L2.342399-.555824C2.47143-.039702 2.60046 .10918 2.918073 .10918C3.295239 .10918 3.5533-.12903 4.128975-1.022318Z\" id=\"m026_g16-71\"></path></defs><g id=\"m026_page1\"><use x=\"-68.811955\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g10-76\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"-61.150694\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g20-77\" y=\"-54.047368\"></use><use x=\"-54.685237\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g20-65\" y=\"-54.047368\"></use><use x=\"-49.434325\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g20-69\" y=\"-54.047368\"></use><use x=\"-41.725233\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g1-61\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"-25.448582\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g23-49\" y=\"-62.286445\"></use><rect height=\".557905\" width=\"16.936443\" x=\"-31.426151\" y=\"-58.381092\"></rect><use x=\"-31.027645\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g10-106\" y=\"-48.707392\"></use><use x=\"-28.636614\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g10-77\" y=\"-48.707392\"></use><use x=\"-16.880713\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g10-106\" y=\"-48.707392\"></use><use x=\"-10.164087\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g4-213\" y=\"-65.736003\"></use><use x=\"-11.633795\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g13-56\" y=\"-43.659078\"></use><use x=\"-8.575619\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g7-50\" y=\"-43.659078\"></use><use x=\"-3.804721\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g7-77\" y=\"-43.659078\"></use><use x=\"6.644709\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g10-107\" y=\"-55.556692\"></use><use x=\"11.127895\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g16-71\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"15.850186\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g13-56\" y=\"-54.047368\"></use><use x=\"21.18399\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g10-0\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"30.102706\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g16-25\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"38.39163\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g10-185\" y=\"-55.556692\"></use><use x=\"42.386641\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g16-26\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"49.8088\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g10-185\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"53.52486\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g16-71\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"58.683518\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g7-86\" y=\"-54.047368\"></use><use x=\"66.163449\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g10-186\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"69.979125\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g10-186\" y=\"-55.556692\"></use><use x=\"73.794755\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g13-56\" y=\"-53.220467\"></use><use x=\"77.412827\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g10-107\" y=\"-55.556692\"></use><use x=\"81.895992\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g20-50\" y=\"-59.797974\"></use><use x=\"81.895992\" xlink:href=\"#m026_g20-50\" y=\"-52.657272\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">对比学习依赖强增强和大 batch，ViT 预训练计算昂贵</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Contrastive SSL depended heavily on hand-crafted view augmentations, while full-token ViT pretraining was computationally expensive.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">高比例遮挡图像 patch，仅让重型 encoder 处理可见 token，再轻量重建</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Exploit high spatial redundancy in images by dropping 75% of patches before the encoder and reconstructing raw normalized pixels.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">约 75% masking 与非对称 encoder-decoder 显著降低计算</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Asymmetric encoder–decoder design (encoder processes only 25% visible tokens → &gt;3× compute reduction) + high masking ratio.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">成为 2D、3D MRI/CT 与病理预训练的基础方法</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Workhorse self-supervised pretraining method for 3D CT/MRI volumes, gigapixel pathology, retinal OCT, and biosignals.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">基础设施级 SSL；像素重建可能偏重低层强度</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Core SSL infrastructure; pixel-level MSE emphasizes fine texture and intensity, shining brightest under downstream fine-tuning.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">自然图像存在高空间冗余，因此高遮蔽率迫使 encoder 学习对象结构而非局部复制。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">遮蔽 token 不进入 encoder，计算集中在可见内容，形成重 encoder、轻 decoder 的非对称设计。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">重建损失只监督不可见 patch，避免模型把能力浪费在已知像素的恒等映射。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Exploit high spatial redundancy in images by dropping 75% of patches before the encoder and reconstructing raw normalized pixels.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Asymmetric encoder–decoder design (encoder processes only 25% visible tokens → &gt;3× compute reduction) + high masking ratio.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Masked Patch Pixel Mean-Squared Error Computed Strictly on Masked Tokens.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">在 CT/MR 中可扩展为 3D block 遮蔽，但遮蔽尺度必须小心保留微小病灶与薄层结构。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">像素重建容易偏向低频解剖；加入器官感知、频域或多模态目标可提高临床语义密度。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Workhorse self-supervised pretraining method for 3D CT/MRI volumes, gigapixel pathology, retinal OCT, and biosignals.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Core SSL infrastructure; pixel-level MSE emphasizes fine texture and intensity, shining brightest under downstream fine-tuning.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2022/html/He_Masked_Autoencoders_Are_Scalable_Vision_Learners_CVPR_2022_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Masked Autoencoders Are Scalable Vision Learners</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/facebookresearch/mae\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}